## Task
Create health.go with a health check endpoint.
- Add a method healthRoutes(mux *http.ServeMux) that registers
  GET /healthz -> handleHealth.
- handleHealth responds 200 with data {"status": "ok", "users": N,
  "products": N, "orders": N} where each N is the number of stored items.
  Use a healthResponse struct with JSON tags for the payload.
Do not modify any other file. Follow the conventions of the existing handlers.

